  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Ultra Prism prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 20–21 and 27–28 January 2018. Each kit held four Ultra Prism booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Ultra Prism logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Magnezone and Heatran, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
